WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:03.800
(Episode 3)

3
00:03.880 --> 00:05.690
This city is my one true love.

4
00:07.930 --> 00:09.890
I'm going to take everything for myself.

5
00:11.450 --> 00:12.990
And anyone who dares get in my way...

6
00:14.850 --> 00:16.150
I'll kill them.

7
00:16.660 --> 00:17.660
I'm begging you.

8
00:20.770 --> 00:22.570
Please save the Kirii-gumi.

9
00:28.430 --> 00:30.270
What would you do if something happened to me?

10
00:33.610 --> 00:34.610
I won't let that happen.

11
00:36.070 --> 00:37.870
This time, I'll protect you no matter what.

12
00:39.310 --> 00:40.970
Dead or alive, we're in this together.

13
00:45.910 --> 00:48.030
Come to think of it, I don't think I ever told you...

14
00:48.570 --> 00:50.390
why I married you in the first place.

15
00:54.810 --> 00:56.330
I'll tell you once we get back.

16
00:58.150 --> 00:59.150
Ren.

17
01:13.860 --> 01:15.610
O-Odajima!

18
01:23.700 --> 01:25.240
Ren-Ren... No, wait.

19
01:25.710 --> 01:26.920
Odajima-san!

20
01:26.960 --> 01:28.040
Are you okay?

21
01:28.300 --> 01:29.080
Go after them!

22
01:29.130 --> 01:30.880
- But... - Just go!

23
01:48.350 --> 01:49.550
A kidnapping, huh?

24
01:50.370 --> 01:51.570
Brings back memories.

25
01:51.830 --> 01:54.230
I used to have my guys pull this kind of thing all the time.

26
01:54.650 --> 01:56.670
Still, I'd much rather be having lunch right now.

27
02:01.070 --> 02:02.160
Come on, give me a smile.

28
02:02.240 --> 02:04.120
Don't leave me hanging here, it's embarrassing.

29
02:06.510 --> 02:07.510
So...

30
02:09.030 --> 02:10.670
where are you guys taking me?

31
03:26.000 --> 03:28.000
The Journey To Killing You Season 2.

32
03:29.960 --> 03:32.990
Yeah, I went after them, but I lost the tail...

33
03:34.910 --> 03:35.910
I'm really sorry!

34
03:36.330 --> 03:37.330
Excuse me.

35
03:42.930 --> 03:43.930
Are you holding up okay?

36
03:44.470 --> 03:45.470
Hold on.

37
03:45.850 --> 03:46.850
Odajima-san.

38
03:47.490 --> 03:48.590
It's too dangerous.

39
03:49.520 --> 03:50.590
Hey, wait up!

40
03:56.690 --> 03:59.096
- Did you sell him out? - What the hell are you talking about?

41
03:59.120 --> 04:00.290
Kataoka-san.

42
04:01.170 --> 04:02.626
He was snatched right off the street.

43
04:02.650 --> 04:03.800
Who did you sell him to?

44
04:04.320 --> 04:05.370
Are you out of your mind?

45
04:06.040 --> 04:08.720
I owe his old man a huge debt from way back.

46
04:13.430 --> 04:14.630
If anything, you guys...

47
04:14.830 --> 04:16.580
were already being tailed, weren't you?

48
04:21.450 --> 04:23.890
The only ones bold enough to pull a kidnapping around here...

49
04:24.430 --> 04:25.930
are VOID.

50
04:27.490 --> 04:28.490
VOID?

51
04:31.110 --> 04:32.350
You know, that gang of punks...

52
04:33.160 --> 04:36.920
giving your Kirii-gumi such a massive headache in Awakuma.

53
04:45.390 --> 04:46.490
Please, wait!

54
04:46.910 --> 04:48.370
Those VOID guys are bad news.

55
04:48.620 --> 04:50.920
They play dirty. If we make a reckless move,

56
04:51.350 --> 04:52.439
Kataoka-san might...

57
04:52.440 --> 04:54.030
never make it back alive!

58
04:55.610 --> 04:56.610
I'm begging you!

59
04:57.000 --> 04:59.640
Let's talk this over with Boss Kumakura first.

60
05:00.810 --> 05:01.810
Please!

61
05:16.970 --> 05:18.950
Well, this is a real mess.

62
05:22.520 --> 05:24.910
Why the hell would those VOID punks...

63
05:26.390 --> 05:27.490
What's our move?

64
05:32.210 --> 05:33.510
Stay away from them.

65
05:34.850 --> 05:36.590
Then what about Kataoka-san?

66
05:37.160 --> 05:38.160
Hey.

67
05:40.260 --> 05:41.870
What happened to that bastard Kataoka?

68
05:44.590 --> 05:45.790
Boss...

69
06:12.160 --> 06:13.820
Isn't this a luxury hotel?

70
06:15.000 --> 06:16.760
Bet they've got an open-air hot spring, too.

71
06:29.220 --> 06:30.420
What are you doing here?

72
06:33.360 --> 06:34.560
Where's Kataoka?

73
06:36.100 --> 06:37.300
Did you two break up?

74
06:39.760 --> 06:40.760
No.

75
06:44.440 --> 06:45.920
I was the one who asked them to come.

76
06:47.020 --> 06:48.020
Huh?

77
06:50.500 --> 06:51.700
I wanted to ask Kataoka...

78
06:52.600 --> 06:53.900
to help save the Kirii-gumi...

79
06:54.480 --> 06:55.480
from this crisis.

80
06:57.780 --> 06:58.880
You asked Kataoka?

81
07:05.760 --> 07:07.320
What the hell is that supposed to mean?

82
07:08.260 --> 07:09.820
You expect me to beg that guy for help?

83
07:12.040 --> 07:13.040
I am deeply sorry.

84
07:13.920 --> 07:14.920
But right now...

85
07:15.540 --> 07:16.540
this is an emergency.

86
07:18.000 --> 07:19.000
Kataoka...

87
07:19.360 --> 07:20.560
has been taken.

88
07:21.460 --> 07:22.620
I'm afraid VOID is behind it.

89
07:25.100 --> 07:26.320
That's none of our business.

90
07:32.860 --> 07:34.060
Get out.

91
08:10.380 --> 08:11.480
Odajima-san!

92
08:13.920 --> 08:15.080
Please, let me come with you.

93
08:20.400 --> 08:21.500
Appreciate it!

94
08:37.010 --> 08:38.600
Quite the warm welcome you've got here.

95
08:39.560 --> 08:41.720
Makes me wanna pop a bottle of champagne to celebrate.

96
08:46.460 --> 08:48.140
Hey, it's rude to ignore people, you know.

97
09:36.740 --> 09:37.740
Odajima-san?

98
09:40.030 --> 09:41.570
Are you guys with VOID?

99
09:41.620 --> 09:42.840
Where is Kataoka-san?!

100
09:42.950 --> 09:43.780
Who the hell does this guy think he is?

101
09:43.870 --> 09:45.070
Hey, what's your problem, man?

102
09:48.450 --> 09:50.500
- Odajima-san! - Let go!

103
09:51.420 --> 09:52.720
Where is Kataoka-san?!

104
09:54.760 --> 09:56.050
Hey, let's bounce.

105
09:57.920 --> 09:58.920
Hold it!

106
10:04.640 --> 10:06.590
- Stop! - Don't run!

107
10:07.730 --> 10:08.730
Damn it!

108
10:09.600 --> 10:10.600
Stop right there!

109
10:12.500 --> 10:13.500
Get back here!

110
10:13.960 --> 10:14.960
Hey! Stop!

111
10:34.000 --> 10:35.380
- Cut them off! - Got it!

112
10:54.020 --> 10:55.029
Hey! Freeze!

113
10:55.030 --> 10:56.030
Hey!

114
10:57.040 --> 11:00.160
No, don't! It's too dangerous!

115
11:00.270 --> 11:02.450
Calm down, Ren-Ren.

116
11:36.230 --> 11:37.330
What's that awful smell?

117
11:39.860 --> 11:40.860
Don't tell me...

118
11:48.580 --> 11:50.349
Whoa! Whoa!

119
11:50.350 --> 11:52.060
A stinkbug! Ugh, it's a stinkbug!

120
11:52.400 --> 11:54.060
Hey! There's a stinkbug in here! Hey!

121
12:14.560 --> 12:17.110
Ahhh!

122
12:21.650 --> 12:25.120
Ugh, it reeks!

123
13:13.010 --> 13:14.210
Wait, could this van be...

124
13:18.050 --> 13:19.050
Odajima!

125
13:28.310 --> 13:29.590
What do yakuza want around here?

126
13:30.710 --> 13:32.479
Where's the owner of this van?

127
13:32.480 --> 13:35.480
Is it owned by some young guy?

128
13:36.830 --> 13:38.510
Whoa, demanding answers right off the bat?

129
13:39.310 --> 13:40.510
That's private information.

130
13:41.130 --> 13:42.530
I can't just hand that over to you.

131
13:45.850 --> 13:46.950
Huh?

132
13:48.170 --> 13:49.270
Wait, aren't you...

133
13:51.150 --> 13:52.150
Ren-Ren?

134
13:55.130 --> 13:57.660
I knew it! It is Ren-Ren!

135
13:57.790 --> 13:58.950
Man, oh man.

136
13:59.080 --> 14:01.240
I almost didn't recognize you without the aloha shirt.

137
14:03.760 --> 14:05.290
KinRen.

138
14:06.630 --> 14:08.030
I watch your channel, you know.

139
14:09.730 --> 14:11.820
Okinawa looked like a blast.

140
14:14.050 --> 14:15.050
And Kin-Kin...

141
14:16.230 --> 14:17.430
Speaking of young Kataoka...

142
14:18.270 --> 14:19.270
Oh...

143
14:19.850 --> 14:20.870
Well, this is bad.

144
14:20.980 --> 14:22.740
There's a scratch right here.

145
14:23.490 --> 14:24.970
Looks like you owe me some cash, huh?

146
14:25.630 --> 14:26.830
Hold on, that scratch...

147
14:28.050 --> 14:30.010
You put that there yourself just now, didn't you?

148
14:31.870 --> 14:34.290
Are you seriously accusing a customer right now?

149
14:35.820 --> 14:39.480
Now my feelings are hurt, right along with my car.

150
14:39.890 --> 14:41.976
You're gonna have to pay for my emotional distress, too.

151
14:42.000 --> 14:43.600
Cough up the money, bastard!

152
14:45.470 --> 14:46.900
Oh, man.

153
14:47.200 --> 14:49.790
Look at the rear end on this beauty. Gorgeous.

154
14:51.010 --> 14:52.010
Huh?

155
14:52.850 --> 14:53.850
Pops,

156
14:54.330 --> 14:55.610
your craftsmanship is top-notch.

157
14:58.690 --> 15:00.470
With an eye for detail like yours,

158
15:01.170 --> 15:03.250
there's no way you'd just leave a scratch like that.

159
15:03.360 --> 15:04.640
Anyone can see that a mile away.

160
15:05.370 --> 15:06.370
Excuse me?

161
15:06.440 --> 15:07.990
Mind your own damn business, pal.

162
15:08.030 --> 15:09.710
- Bro! - What?!

163
15:10.330 --> 15:11.190
That guy...

164
15:11.240 --> 15:12.720
He's the second-in-command of the Kirii-gumi.

165
15:12.740 --> 15:14.079
Wait, for real?

166
15:14.080 --> 15:15.290
Crap, let's get out of here!

167
15:15.950 --> 15:16.850
Sorry to bother you!

168
15:16.910 --> 15:17.850
Hey, move it!

169
15:17.880 --> 15:20.100
Sorry about that, please take good care of the car!

170
15:20.290 --> 15:22.850
- Hey, wait for me! - Don't let the door hit you on the way out.

171
15:25.590 --> 15:28.510
Driving a ride like this every once in a while wouldn't be half bad, huh?

172
15:30.050 --> 15:31.250
Name your price. I'll take it.

173
15:36.710 --> 15:37.710
Here's a deposit.

174
15:38.410 --> 15:40.180
- Uh, wait... - I'll be back.

175
15:48.210 --> 15:49.570
He really is an incredible guy.

176
15:51.540 --> 15:53.260
Anyone who meets young Kataoka...

177
15:53.320 --> 15:55.010
can't help but be drawn to him.

178
15:59.510 --> 16:00.510
That's true.

179
16:02.490 --> 16:04.930
Looks like you're trying to track down the owner of that van,

180
16:05.110 --> 16:06.930
but that's just a delivery vehicle.

181
16:07.610 --> 16:09.660
And the owner's no kid, either.

182
16:11.190 --> 16:12.190
That said...

183
16:12.590 --> 16:13.710
I do know a gang of punks...

184
16:14.530 --> 16:16.760
who are always cruising around in the exact same model.

185
16:17.510 --> 16:18.520
Please!

186
16:18.790 --> 16:20.570
Tell us everything you know about them.

187
16:24.710 --> 16:25.810
All right.

188
16:26.520 --> 16:28.880
I'll tell you where they hang out. You can go check it out.

189
16:44.470 --> 16:46.350
That must be the van the old man told us about.

190
16:55.600 --> 16:56.600
Those bastards...

191
17:00.070 --> 17:01.070
I'll go in alone.

192
17:01.870 --> 17:02.870
Odajima-san?

193
17:04.610 --> 17:05.610
If anything goes south,

194
17:05.810 --> 17:07.160
call Boss Kumakura immediately.

195
17:07.390 --> 17:08.390
Odajima-san...

196
17:10.210 --> 17:12.280
This is a really bad idea!

197
17:58.670 --> 17:59.970
Where is he?

198
18:15.050 --> 18:16.630
What the hell are you doing?! Hey!

199
18:50.180 --> 18:51.180
That guy...

200
18:52.180 --> 18:53.860
I bet he's doing something reckless again.

201
19:05.220 --> 19:06.940
Did you get it all out of your system, kid?

202
19:10.400 --> 19:12.040
Man, you've got some serious fire in you.

203
19:13.660 --> 19:15.180
From the very beginning, I was just...

204
19:16.880 --> 19:18.560
a mistake who never should've been born...

205
19:20.260 --> 19:22.070
into this world anyway.

206
19:23.330 --> 19:24.330
So naturally, my life...

207
19:26.360 --> 19:27.950
has no meaning at all.

208
19:40.840 --> 19:42.040
Don't push it.

209
19:43.800 --> 19:44.800
Odajima.

210
20:17.760 --> 20:18.900
That's enough!

211
20:19.090 --> 20:20.090
Hold on.

212
20:28.320 --> 20:29.880
Since you're dying to see him so badly,

213
20:30.020 --> 20:31.320
I'll grant your wish.

214
20:58.560 --> 20:59.760
Odajima-san...

215
21:00.460 --> 21:01.660
I hope he's okay...

216
21:35.220 --> 21:36.220
Odajima-san.

217
21:38.000 --> 21:39.040
This is bad.

218
22:36.560 --> 22:37.930
They're on the move.

219
22:41.000 --> 22:42.200
Did he take the bait?

220
22:44.260 --> 22:45.460
That was fast.

221
23:00.730 --> 23:02.729
Everything is...

222
23:02.730 --> 23:04.030
right in the palm of my hand.

223
23:31.910 --> 23:32.870
(Next Episode Preview)

224
23:32.920 --> 23:34.800
You actually risked your neck to come after me.

225
23:35.370 --> 23:37.170
Did you miss me that much?

226
23:37.580 --> 23:38.680
If I wanted to see you,

227
23:39.140 --> 23:40.240
this was the only way.

228
23:40.630 --> 23:42.870
I told you, I have no obligation to get involved.

229
23:43.250 --> 23:44.530
If we let a civilian get killed,

230
23:44.960 --> 23:46.280
it'd be a disgrace to our family.

231
23:47.130 --> 23:48.130
Boss.

232
23:48.360 --> 23:50.460
You think you're pulling all the strings,

233
23:50.940 --> 23:52.826
when you're really just being played for a fool.

234
23:52.850 --> 23:53.850
I have never once...

235
23:54.180 --> 23:57.320
thought about leaving your side.

236
23:57.560 --> 24:01.350
Never underestimate the resolve of an ex-yakuza!
